+Organize ideas, manage startups, track momentum, and build a connected company ecosystem from one platform.
+
+Goals:
+- make the site feel expensive, premium, and category-defining
+- make it feel more like Apple than a generic SaaS dashboard
+- reduce clutter
+- simplify the layout
+- use bigger typography
+- rely more on spacing and composition than borders and cards
+- keep it responsive and production-ready
+
